Word/Content.MSO/BDA31D31.tmp](/sys_attachment.do?sys_id=60d48879933b2ad4d9743f986cba10a1)#**19\\. _What if there are already existing plans for a ServiceNow instance version upgrade_?**":[232,235],"#**Overview** ![/var/folders/yf/th6p6wl97g306fv3hqx440lw0000gn/T/com.microsoft.Word/Content.MSO/BDA31D31.tmp](/sys_attachment.do?sys_id=60d48879933b2ad4d9743f986cba10a1)#**19\\. _What if there are already existing plans for a ServiceNow instance version upgrade_?**#{1}":[234,235],"#**Overview** ![/var/folders/yf/th6p6wl97g306fv3hqx440lw0000gn/T/com.microsoft.Word/Content.MSO/BDA31D31.tmp](/sys_attachment.do?sys_id=60d48879933b2ad4d9743f986cba10a1)#**20\\. _After you schedule the instance migration date/time, what happens if you're not ready by that date_?**":[236,239],"#**Overview** ![/var/folders/yf/th6p6wl97g306fv3hqx440lw0000gn/T/com.microsoft.Word/Content.MSO/BDA31D31.tmp](/sys_attachment.do?sys_id=60d48879933b2ad4d9743f986cba10a1)#**20\\. _After you schedule the instance migration date/time, what happens if you're not ready by that date_?**#{1}":[238,239],"#**Overview** ![/var/folders/yf/th6p6wl97g306fv3hqx440lw0000gn/T/com.microsoft.Word/Content.MSO/BDA31D31.tmp](/sys_attachment.do?sys_id=60d48879933b2ad4d9743f986cba10a1)#**21\\. _How long will the move take, and is there any downtime during the move_?**":[240,245],"#**Overview** ![/var/folders/yf/th6p6wl97g306fv3hqx440lw0000gn/T/com.microsoft.Word/Content.MSO/BDA31D31.tmp](/sys_attachment.do?sys_id=60d48879933b2ad4d9743f986cba10a1)#**21\\. _How long will the move take, and is there any downtime during the move_?**#{1}":[242,245],"#**Overview** ![/var/folders/yf/th6p6wl97g306fv3hqx440lw0000gn/T/com.microsoft.Word/Content.MSO/BDA31D31.tmp](/sys_attachment.do?sys_id=60d48879933b2ad4d9743f986cba10a1)#**22\\. _What happens if you have instances in the Commercial and GCC environments concurrently? Can you access instances in both environments concurrently_?**":[246,251],"#**Overview** ![/var/folders/yf/th6p6wl97g306fv3hqx440lw0000gn/T/com.microsoft.Word/Content.MSO/BDA31D31.tmp](/sys_attachment.do?sys_id=60d48879933b2ad4d9743f986cba10a1)#**22\\. _What happens if you have instances in the Commercial and GCC environments concurrently? Can you access instances in both environments concurrently_?**#{1}":[248,251],"#**Overview** ![/var/folders/yf/th6p6wl97g306fv3hqx440lw0000gn/T/com.microsoft.Word/Content.MSO/BDA31D31.tmp](/sys_attachment.do?sys_id=60d48879933b2ad4d9743f986cba10a1)#**23\\. _What happens if you are unable to access an instance after it has migrated into GCC_?**":[252,255],"#**Overview** ![/var/folders/yf/th6p6wl97g306fv3hqx440lw0000gn/T/com.microsoft.Word/Content.MSO/BDA31D31.tmp](/sys_attachment.do?sys_id=60d48879933b2ad4d9743f986cba10a1)#**23\\. _What happens if you are unable to access an instance after it has migrated into GCC_?**#{1}":[254,255],"#**Overview** ![/var/folders/yf/th6p6wl97g306fv3hqx440lw0000gn/T/com.microsoft.Word/Content.MSO/BDA31D31.tmp](/sys_attachment.do?sys_id=60d48879933b2ad4d9743f986cba10a1)#**24\\. _What is Multi-Factor Authentication_?**":[256,268],"#**Overview** ![/var/folders/yf/th6p6wl97g306fv3hqx440lw0000gn/T/com.microsoft.Word/Content.MSO/BDA31D31.tmp](/sys_attachment.do?sys_id=60d48879933b2ad4d9743f986cba10a1)#**24\\. _What is Multi-Factor Authentication_?**#{1}":[258,263],"#**Overview** ![/var/folders/yf/th6p6wl97g306fv3hqx440lw0000gn/T/com.microsoft.Word/Content.MSO/BDA31D31.tmp](/sys_attachment.do?sys_id=60d48879933b2ad4d9743f986cba10a1)#**24\\. _What is Multi-Factor Authentication_?**#{2}":[264,264],"#**Overview** ![/var/folders/yf/th6p6wl97g306fv3hqx440lw0000gn/T/com.microsoft.Word/Content.MSO/BDA31D31.tmp](/sys_attachment.do?sys_id=60d48879933b2ad4d9743f986cba10a1)#**24\\. _What is Multi-Factor Authentication_?**#{3}":[265,265],"#**Overview** ![/var/folders/yf/th6p6wl97g306fv3hqx440lw0000gn/T/com.microsoft.Word/Content.MSO/BDA31D31.tmp](/sys_attachment.do?sys_id=60d48879933b2ad4d9743f986cba10a1)#**24\\. _What is Multi-Factor Authentication_?**#{4}":[266,266],"#**Overview** ![/var/folders/yf/th6p6wl97g306fv3hqx440lw0000gn/T/com.microsoft.Word/Content.MSO/BDA31D31.tmp](/sys_attachment.do?sys_id=60d48879933b2ad4d9743f986cba10a1)#**24\\. _What is Multi-Factor Authentication_?**#{5}":[267,268],"#**Overview** ![/var/folders/yf/th6p6wl97g306fv3hqx440lw0000gn/T/com.microsoft.Word/Content.MSO/BDA31D31.tmp](/sys_attachment.do?sys_id=60d48879933b2ad4d9743f986cba10a1)#**25\\. _After the migration into GCC, what action do you take if unable to Clone-down Production instances to Sub-Production instances_?**":[269,274],"#**Overview** ![/var/folders/yf/th6p6wl97g306fv3hqx440lw0000gn/T/com.microsoft.Word/Content.MSO/BDA31D31.tmp](/sys_attachment.do?sys_id=60d48879933b2ad4d9743f986cba10a1)#**25\\. _After the migration into GCC, what action do you take if unable to Clone-down Production instances to Sub-Production instances_?**#{1}":[271,274],"#**Overview** ![/var/folders/yf/th6p6wl97g306fv3hqx440lw0000gn/T/com.microsoft.Word/Content.MSO/BDA31D31.tmp](/sys_attachment.do?sys_id=60d48879933b2ad4d9743f986cba10a1)#**26\\. _What if you still have questions not answered in this FAQ_?**":[275,278],"#**Overview** ![/var/folders/yf/th6p6wl97g306fv3hqx440lw0000gn/T/com.microsoft.Word/Content.MSO/BDA31D31.tmp](/sys_attachment.do?sys_id=60d48879933b2ad4d9743f986cba10a1)#**26\\. _What if you still have questions not answered in this FAQ_?**#{1}":[277,278],"#**Other Important KB Articles**":[279,299],"#**Other Important KB Articles**#{1}":[281,299],"#Acronyms and Terminology":[300,332],"#Acronyms and Terminology#{1}":[302,324],"#Acronyms and Terminology#Resolution":[325,328],"#Acronyms and Terminology#Resolution#{1}":[327,328],"#Acronyms and Terminology#Text":[329,332],"#Acronyms and Terminology#Text#{1}":[331,332]},"outlinks":[{"title":"/var/folders/yf/th6p6wl97g306fv3hqx440lw0000gn/T/com.microsoft.Word/Content.MSO/1DF1DCB9.tmp","target":"/sys_attachment.do?sys_id=24d4c0b9933b2ad4d9743f986cba106f","line":19,"embedded":true